          "name": "Request or Verify Email OTP",
          "request": {
            "name": "Request or Verify Email OTP",
            "description": {
              "content": "\nHandles both requesting an OTP and verifying it for login/signup.\n\n**Step 1: Request OTP**\n- Provide `email` and `action` ('signup' or 'login').\n- Sends an OTP to the email if validation passes.\n- Returns: `{\"message\": \"OTP sent...\"}`\n\n**Step 2: Verify OTP & Authenticate**\n- Provide `email` and `code` received via email.\n- Optionally provide `auth_type`: 'session' (default) or 'jwt'.\n- Optionally provide `first_name`, `last_name`, `user_role` if signing up.\n- Verifies the code. If valid, creates user (if signup) and authenticates.\n- Returns (Session Auth): `{\"user\": {...}, \"created\": bool, \"auth_type\": \"session\"}` -> Browser receives `sessionid` and `csrftoken` cookies.\n- Returns (JWT Auth, if enabled): `{\"user\": {...}, \"created\": bool, \"auth_type\": \"jwt\", \"access\": \"...\", \"refresh\": \"...\"}`\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "otp"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
